  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence from substrate outward: SiO2, HfO2, Al2O3, HfO2, Al2O3, SiO2, HfO2, Al2O3, SiO2, HfO2, Al2O3, SiO2, HfO2, Al2O3, SiO2, HfO2. Initialize thicknesses to [21.36, 66.22, 44.85, 121.12, 46.71, 23.87, 17.77, 48.79, 27.57, 107.85, 46.87, 27.01, 32.56, 54.29, 77.79, 16.29] nm. Optimize all 16 thicknesses with bounds 15-200 nm using gradient-based optimizer. Evaluate transmittance at normal incidence across three bands: 255-280 nm (maximize), 300-700 nm (minimize), 700-1100 nm (minimize). Apply ±20% thickness tolerance for robustness analysis. No metal layers permitted. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 255-280 nm, 300-700 nm, 700-1100 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 255–280 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Transmittance in 300–700 nm; Transmittance in 700–1100 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers; No metal layers; Only conventional depositable inorganic dielectric materials.",
